{"parentUuid":"c0b65e02-0444-4f5f-82f1-ae92067ceaf1","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ac3048c66f3643aa6","attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14689300 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"07870db7-fa17-4e52-8568-d65d269208af","timestamp":"2026-10-14T18:19:54.148Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14689300 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"07870db7-fa17-4e52-8568-d65d269208af","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ac3048c66f3643aa6","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cg2bGnUSGRW3cWEvdw3Yf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Summary of what shipped (commit `a6b11ab`, pushed to `github/main`):\n\n**New module `cuore/live/mes_learn.py`** — the two-adapter guard (refuses an empty port, fewer than two serial ports present, or a port matching MES's own configured adapter), the start/stop/status/candidates/accept/reject capture lifecycle (passive-only, never transmits), and a pure `align()` function that reassembles ISO-TP, pairs UDS request/response, and least-squares-fits each named MES CSV column against every `(module, DID, offset, width, signedness)` seen — confident only at R² ≥ 0.98 over ≥ 20 distinct raw values.\n\n**`cuore/live/learned.py`** (additive) — `accept_mes`/`reject_mes`/`learned_mes` with confidence `SINGLE-SOURCE (learned)`, plus `learned_mes_channels()` which hands back ready Live-board `Channel` objects. Caught and fixed a real formula bug along the way: `readall._signed()` guesses byte-width by magnitude, so wrapping a combined 16-bit value in `SIGNED()` misreads small values as 8-bit negatives — fixed by sign-correcting the high byte alone.\n\n**API/web/MCP surfaces** — `cuore/api/mes_learn.py`, `cuore/web/mes_learn_routes.py` + `templates/mes_learn.html` (`/v/{vin}/learn-mes`), and a new marked block in `obd2-mcp/server.py` (`mes_learn_start/stop/status/candidates/accept`), all wired into `cuore/app.py`.\n\n**Docs** — new handbook section 9 with the hardware list and procedure.\n\n**Tests** — `cuore/tests/check_mes_learn.py`, 56 checks, all green, using only synthetic fakes (no real COM port ever opened). Also reran `check_learn.py`, `check_buscapture.py`, and `check_api_contract.py` to confirm nothing else regressed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1248,"cache_read_input_tokens":309516,"output_tokens":686,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1248},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":686,"cache_read_input_tokens":309516,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1248,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1248,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b3790f5a-a02e-48c7-8604-8da171c68981","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cg2bGnBZvLtqPJnX6Nwyv","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"9a4102fa-bcf2-4fc9-8c91-d0ab4887fd98","timestamp":"2026-10-14T18:20:02.744Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
